{'symbol': 'TECH', 'date': '2022-12-01 07:00:00', 'title': 'BIO-TECHNE AND OXFORD NANOPORE TECHNOLOGIES PARTNER TO BRING INNOVATIVE REPRODUCTIVE HEALTH AND CARRIER SCREENING SOLUTIONS TO THE MARKET', 'text': 'NEW COLLABORATION WILL DEVELOP ASSAYS THAT OFFER A STREAMLINED WORKFLOW FOR ANALYSING EVEN THE MOST CHALLENGING GENES. MINNEAPOLIS , DEC. 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ASURAGEN,\xa0A BIO-TECHNE BRAND (NASDAQ: TECH) AND OXFORD NANOPORE TECHNOLOGIES PLC (OXFORD NANOPORE) (LSE: ONT), TODAY ANNOUNCE A COLLABORATION TO DEVELOP ASSAYS DESIGNED TO DELIVER MORE ACCURATE AND RELIABLE OPTIONS FOR REPRODUCTIVE HEALTH AND CARRIER SCREENING.'}